### 1. YOUR ROLE AND MISSION

Act as a principal software architect, senior full-stack engineer, cybersecurity platform engineer, AI systems architect, UI/UX designer, database engineer, DevSecOps engineer, and quality assurance lead.

Your mission is to DESIGN, IMPLEMENT, TEST, and CONTINUOUSLY IMPROVE a new software platform named:

**BARON NEXUS — AI Cybersecurity Operations Platform**

This must be a new, independently structured, professional application inspired by the broad scope of the supplied Al-Baron Cyber Empire source code, but with better architecture, usability, security, maintainability, integration, reliability, and testing.

Do not merely describe the application. Build the actual application in the current Google AI Studio project.

Do not stop after creating a landing page, a dashboard mockup, a collection of static cards, or a prototype containing nonfunctional buttons.

The result must be a functioning full-stack application with real navigation, persistent data, meaningful backend operations, useful cybersecurity workflows, error handling, authentication, authorization, audit trails, and automated tests.

Do not claim that an integration, scanner, security check, AI operation, or external service works unless you have implemented and verified it.

If an external service requires credentials or infrastructure that is unavailable, build a clear integration interface, a safe demonstration mode where appropriate, setup instructions, and explicit connection status. Never fabricate live scan results or pretend that an external service has been contacted.

